#### Protocol identifiers

`packages/rust/quadcortex/proto/*.proto` and
`references/public/cortex-protocol/*.json` record the message, field, and
enumeration names of the device's USB protocol, partly incorporated from
`pyquadcortex` (see "Third-party components"). They are licensed under
`MIT OR Apache-2.0` as to Freevia's own selection, arrangement, and
annotation. Freevia claims no rights in, and grants no
license to, the protocol identifiers themselves, which are reproduced solely
for interoperability.

